      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A rare tumor closely associated with the trigeminal ganglion produced a syndrome of atypical facial pain in a 44-year-old man. Two previous reports have designated similar tumors as \"fibro-osseous lesions.\" The distinctive morphological appearance is illustrated and possible histogenesis discussed."},
